<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras BR Q1 net 34.4 mln reais-report.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras BR Q1 net 34.4 mln reais-report.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil products distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of federal oil monopoly Petrobras, posted a first quarter net profit of 34.4 million reais ($32.5 million), a local news agency said.</p>
<p>Invest News said net revenue in the period was 1.98 billion reais ($1.87 billion).</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
